1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,480
But now, if this is how it is, I wish
you'd kept on being a jerk to me!

2
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:11,780
If you had, I wouldn't have
realized how I felt about you!

3
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:16,005
I wouldn't have felt sad and
jealous when I found out about her!

4
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:17,897
And I wouldn't have tried forgetting about

5
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:20,568
you and FALLING IN LOVE
WITH Kirito instead!

6
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:26,740
I'm sorry.

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,220
Go on.

8
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:38,000
Leave me alone.

9
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:30,920
Let's get on!

10
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:43,920
It's a certain promise.

11
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:48,877
I'm just a little bit.

12
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:51,537
I'm scared of.

13
00:01:51,620 --> 00:01:54,477
I'm in the front of the sky.

14
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:56,480
I'm going to go.

15
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,200
In the future of this moment,

16
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:04,953
I'll turn on your face.

17
00:02:31,420 --> 00:02:35,480
It felt weird, like I didn't
fit in with them anymore.

18
00:02:36,300 --> 00:02:39,420
And I found this out when I was ten.

19
00:02:47,540 --> 00:02:50,000
I'd wonder, who is she?

20
00:02:50,300 --> 00:02:53,780
And do I really know anything about her?

21
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:57,760
Maybe that feeling I had of not fitting in

22
00:02:58,520 --> 00:03:01,167
was the thing that drove
me to online gaming.

23
00:03:02,380 --> 00:03:07,360
I guess I figured, in the virtual world,
no one knows anything about anyone.

24
00:03:07,940 --> 00:03:11,340
So I dove right in and thought
it was where I belonged.

25
00:03:13,300 --> 00:03:17,006
But those two years I spent
trapped in SAO taught me something.

26
00:03:17,740 --> 00:03:21,800
The difference between a real and
a virtual world is slim at best.

27
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:25,955
It's a waste of time asking
people who they really are.

28
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:30,480
All you can do is accept them
as is, and have faith in them.

29
00:03:31,020 --> 00:03:35,432
Because in the end, whoever you think
they are, that's who they really are.

30
00:03:37,300 --> 00:03:43,340
When I got back to the real world and saw
Sugu's face, I was really, truly happy.

31
00:03:44,700 --> 00:03:45,935
Right then and there,

32
00:03:46,060 --> 00:03:50,017
I swore I'd do whatever I
could to try to close the gap

33
00:03:50,100 --> 00:03:53,500
that had grown between us
over the last couple of years.

34
00:03:56,220 --> 00:03:57,840
But how do I do that?

35
00:04:03,660 --> 00:04:06,580
What can I do for Sugu?

36
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:14,640
Sugu, I'll wait for you and
Arun on the North Terrace.

37
00:04:26,820 --> 00:04:29,120
How could I be so horrible to you?

38
00:04:29,500 --> 00:04:32,220
And how could you be so strong?

39
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:36,220
I wish I could be as
strong as you, big brother.

40
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:41,860
I told you to hang in there, to
not give up on the one you love.

41
00:04:42,180 --> 00:04:43,800
But I can't do that.

42
00:04:44,080 --> 00:04:47,140
And now, I can't stop crying.

43
00:05:13,620 --> 00:05:16,740
I guess this is how it is.

44
00:05:21,180 --> 00:05:22,060
Leafa?

45
00:05:24,500 --> 00:05:25,380
Hi!

46
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:27,997
You know, I've been
looking all over for you.

47
00:05:28,080 --> 00:05:29,845
Wait, what are you doing here?

48
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:32,717
I thought the salamanders caught you.

49
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:35,437
Yeah, well, I sort of
poisoned them all and escaped.

50
00:05:35,520 --> 00:05:36,917
No way, you poisoned them?

51
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:39,857
Big time, and after I got
away, I tracked to here.

52
00:05:39,940 --> 00:05:41,957
Hang on, what are you doing here alone?

53
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:43,216
Where's that spring?

54
00:05:44,700 --> 00:05:50,420
Oh, yeah, well, I kind of said
something really mean to him.

55
00:05:51,080 --> 00:05:53,137
It wasn't cool, and I
shouldn't have said it.

56
00:05:53,220 --> 00:05:56,380
But it was pretty stupid of me.

57
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,740
Oh, never mind.

58
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,355
I'm just being weird.

59
00:06:02,980 --> 00:06:05,686
I'm not going to be
seeing him around anymore.

60
00:06:06,020 --> 00:06:08,320
Come on, let's go back to Sylvain.

61
00:06:08,740 --> 00:06:10,120
Don't cry like that.

62
00:06:12,620 --> 00:06:13,450
Wait!

63
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:17,080
You shouldn't be crying like that!

64
00:06:18,140 --> 00:06:18,970
Sorry?

65
00:06:19,140 --> 00:06:21,637
The Leafa I know is
always smiling and happy.

66
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:24,960
And I, well, I'd never
leave you like that.

67
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:28,680
I'd stay with you always, in
here and in the real world.

68
00:06:29,500 --> 00:06:34,020
I, I, uh, Leafa, I mean,
Tsuguha, I love you.

69
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:36,140
You what?

70
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:38,240
Wait, don't do that.

71
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:39,753
No, what are you doing?

72
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:47,000
Are you okay?

73
00:06:48,520 --> 00:06:50,780
Oh, where did I go wrong?

74
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:54,937
After everything I've said and done, I
thought all I had to do was find the guts?

75
00:06:55,020 --> 00:06:56,785
to confess my feelings to you.

76
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:59,299
You really are a moron, aren't you?

77
00:07:05,220 --> 00:07:07,985
Even so, I could learn
a thing or two from you.

78
00:07:29,980 --> 00:07:30,810
Hey.

79
00:07:31,420 --> 00:07:32,440
Here I am.

80
00:07:34,200 --> 00:07:35,440
Sugu, I...

81
00:07:36,620 --> 00:07:39,120
Kazuto, I want a rematch. Huh?

82
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:41,946
Let's finish what we started.

83
00:07:48,340 --> 00:07:50,480
And this time, no holding back.

84
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:04,880
Now I know why he looks so composed.

85
00:08:07,740 --> 00:08:08,660
Here I come!

86
00:08:21,440 --> 00:08:22,270
Oh, my God.

87
00:09:10,620 --> 00:09:11,980
What are you doing?

88
00:09:12,380 --> 00:09:13,760
What are you doing?

89
00:09:17,580 --> 00:09:20,000
Look, I wanted to apologize.

90
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:24,184
But I just didn't know
how to go about doing it.

91
00:09:25,100 --> 00:09:26,900
So I was gonna throw the duel.

92
00:09:29,380 --> 00:09:30,260
You were?

93
00:09:33,580 --> 00:09:34,620
I'm sorry.

94
00:09:37,820 --> 00:09:39,060
I'm sorry too.

95
00:09:40,820 --> 00:09:46,000
I think my problem is, I never really
came back to the real world after SAO.

96
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:49,480
And I can't come back until she wakes up.

97
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:53,360
In a way, the game
hasn't ended for me yet.

98
00:09:54,540 --> 00:09:59,257
And I guess that's why I still haven't
figured out how I fit in at home or with you.

99
00:09:59,340 --> 00:10:00,420
Not yet, anyway.

100
00:10:03,140 --> 00:10:04,964
And when you do, I'll be there.

101
00:10:05,100 --> 00:10:07,097
It doesn't matter how long it takes.

102
00:10:07,180 --> 00:10:10,533
I'll be waiting for the day
you come back to us for real.

103
00:10:10,620 --> 00:10:13,280
Until then, I'll help you in here.

104
00:10:23,880 --> 00:10:26,840
So, uh, wait, what's going on again?

105
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:29,917
Three players are going to
raid the World Tree today.

106
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:33,900
He's player one, you're player
two, and yours truly makes three.

107
00:10:34,500 --> 00:10:35,740
Oh, okay.

108
00:10:36,180 --> 00:10:37,560
Wait, what?

109
00:10:38,140 --> 00:10:39,580
Yui, you there?

110
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:45,177
Hi, Daddy, what is it?

111
00:10:45,260 --> 00:10:47,260
I need some info on the Guardians.

112
00:10:47,540 --> 00:10:48,657
You learn anything?

113
00:10:48,740 --> 00:10:51,977
The stats for one aren't very
high, but that's not the problem.

114
00:10:52,060 --> 00:10:53,717
There's just too many of them.

115
00:10:53,800 --> 00:10:58,035
As I see it, this quest was designed
to be next to impossible to finish.

116
00:10:58,160 --> 00:11:02,300
So what you're saying is they all
add up to one unbeatable boss, huh?

117
00:11:02,740 --> 00:11:06,017
Yes, but don't forget your
skills and XP are really high.

118
00:11:06,100 --> 00:11:09,757
So maybe with a burst of speed
you can smash right through them.

119
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:10,670
Mm-hmm.

120
00:11:10,900 --> 00:11:14,160
Hey guys, this isn't your fight.

121
00:11:14,800 --> 00:11:17,957
The only way I'm going to get
through is with your help.

122
00:11:18,040 --> 00:11:21,100
But time's running out,
so we have to go now.

123
00:11:23,820 --> 00:11:24,650
Don't worry.

124
00:11:24,733 --> 00:11:26,757
I'll do whatever I can
to get you up there.

125
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:27,670
You ready?

126
00:11:27,753 --> 00:11:29,211
Let's see that game face.

127
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:30,910
Huh?

128
00:11:30,993 --> 00:11:33,817
Well, I guess I don't have a choice since
we were destined to be together forever.

129
00:11:33,900 --> 00:11:34,730
Oh, hey!

130
00:11:34,813 --> 00:11:35,659
Don't talk stupid.

131
00:11:36,160 --> 00:11:37,620
Oh, sorry. Jeez.

132
00:11:38,780 --> 00:11:40,133
We're in this together.

133
00:11:54,900 --> 00:11:55,730
Thanks, guys.

134
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:56,960
I mean it.

135
00:11:58,700 --> 00:12:00,617
I'll draw the Guardian's attention.

136
00:12:00,700 --> 00:12:02,697
While I do, stay back and heal me.

137
00:12:02,780 --> 00:12:04,956
You shouldn't be in any danger, then.

138
00:12:11,940 --> 00:12:12,770
Let's go.

139
00:12:25,460 --> 00:12:27,840
The End

140
00:12:55,060 --> 00:12:56,280
That's awesome!

141
00:12:56,620 --> 00:12:58,149
There's a lot more coming!

142
00:13:21,100 --> 00:13:22,560
There's so many of them!

143
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:33,500
Now, Recon! Right!

144
00:13:42,940 --> 00:13:45,717
Why are the Guardians
targeting us instead of him?

145
00:13:45,800 --> 00:13:47,957
My guess is they're using
a different targeting

146
00:13:48,040 --> 00:13:50,797
algorithm than any of the
other bosses in the game.

147
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:54,527
It looks like we're going to be
doing some fighting after all.

148
00:13:57,180 --> 00:13:58,010
Wait!

149
00:13:58,780 --> 00:13:59,898
What are you doing?

150
00:14:00,660 --> 00:14:01,620
Wait a sec.

151
00:14:01,940 --> 00:14:07,400
Listen, I'm not sure what's going on here,
but like, is this raid that important?

152
00:14:09,080 --> 00:14:09,910
Yeah.

153
00:14:09,993 --> 00:14:10,937
Yeah, it is.

154
00:14:11,020 --> 00:14:12,817
I don't think it's just a game.

155
00:14:12,900 --> 00:14:14,140
Not now, anyway.

156
00:14:17,260 --> 00:14:20,040
Then I'm gonna help
you help that spriggan!

157
00:14:21,940 --> 00:14:23,760
Wait! Rack on! Ah!

158
00:14:27,420 --> 00:14:29,100
See ya, Marita!

159
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:31,540
Vim glonfito!

160
00:14:38,900 --> 00:14:40,240
No! You idiot!

161
00:14:41,640 --> 00:14:42,470
Heel!

162
00:14:51,420 --> 00:14:53,100
Vergon, that's enough!

163
00:14:53,400 --> 00:14:54,518
Go on, get outside!

164
00:15:06,140 --> 00:15:07,340
No way!

165
00:15:07,780 --> 00:15:09,900
He's using a dark magic spell!

166
00:15:28,220 --> 00:15:30,220
A self-destruct spell!

167
00:15:30,460 --> 00:15:34,137
He used it even though the
penalty's worse than a normal death.

168
00:15:34,220 --> 00:15:35,180
That dummy!

169
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:36,675
What was he thinking?

170
00:15:57,860 --> 00:15:59,260
No!

171
00:16:00,040 --> 00:16:00,870
No!

172
00:16:06,420 --> 00:16:07,250
Oh, no.

173
00:16:07,333 --> 00:16:08,217
Now what?

174
00:16:08,300 --> 00:16:10,980
He can't keep this up, it's impossible!

175
00:16:34,760 --> 00:16:36,517
What are the Sylphs doing here?

176
00:16:36,600 --> 00:16:38,040
No way, they've made it!

177
00:16:44,160 --> 00:16:44,990
Dragons!

178
00:16:45,073 --> 00:16:45,940
It's the catseed!

179
00:16:46,220 --> 00:16:48,220
And they've brought the whole arc!

180
00:16:51,460 --> 00:16:52,440
Hello there!

181
00:16:52,740 --> 00:16:54,034
I hope we're not late!

182
00:16:54,260 --> 00:16:55,100
Yeah, sorry!

183
00:16:55,440 --> 00:16:58,499
It took us a while to get
ready, but we're here now!

184
00:17:00,300 --> 00:17:02,760
Oh! Sakuya! Alicia! Attack!

185
00:17:06,660 --> 00:17:09,900
Okay, Dragoons, get ready
to toast these suckers!

186
00:17:11,040 --> 00:17:13,620
Silk warriors, prepare
to engage the enemy!

187
00:17:16,180 --> 00:17:17,356
Fire breath, attack!

188
00:17:27,120 --> 00:17:28,960
Fenrir storm, fire at will!

189
00:17:37,020 --> 00:17:37,850
Thank you!

190
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:39,706
Thank you so much for coming!

191
00:17:39,840 --> 00:17:41,520
You don't have to thank us.

192
00:17:41,680 --> 00:17:44,817
We can't even begin to repay
that Spriggan for all he's done.

193
00:17:44,900 --> 00:17:46,257
Sakuya's got a point, you know?

194
00:17:46,340 --> 00:17:47,170
I mean,

195
00:17:47,253 --> 00:17:48,083
the only reason we're here for this little

196
00:17:48,166 --> 00:17:50,708
raid is because of all
the money he gave us.

197
00:17:55,140 --> 00:17:55,970
Warriors!

198
00:17:56,053 --> 00:17:57,079
Forward to battle!

199
00:18:08,020 --> 00:18:10,100
Destroying them all! Keep going!

200
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:18,830
Sugu!

201
00:18:32,580 --> 00:18:33,410
Yeah?

202
00:18:35,640 --> 00:18:38,240
Watch my back, okay? You got it!

203
00:18:51,460 --> 00:18:52,700
Follow their lead!

204
00:19:11,920 --> 00:19:13,600
Let's go!

205
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:35,820
You can do it!

206
00:19:36,460 --> 00:19:37,840
Go, Kazuto!

207
00:19:39,520 --> 00:19:40,350
Go!

208
00:20:00,160 --> 00:20:01,397
We're clearing out!

209
00:20:01,480 --> 00:20:02,740
Everyone, fall back!

210
00:20:08,560 --> 00:20:09,820
Keep going.

211
00:20:10,680 --> 00:20:11,510
Fly.

212
00:20:12,640 --> 00:20:15,020
Keep flying as long as you can.

213
00:20:18,980 --> 00:20:20,220
To the very end.

214
00:20:27,780 --> 00:20:28,920
Damn it.

215
00:20:30,960 --> 00:20:32,400
Now what do I do?

216
00:20:38,760 --> 00:20:39,660
Hey, Yui!

217
00:20:39,980 --> 00:20:40,840
Yes, Daddy?

218
00:20:45,540 --> 00:20:47,860
Daddy, something strange is going on.

219
00:20:48,260 --> 00:20:50,554
This door isn't locked by a quest flag.

220
00:20:50,820 --> 00:20:53,173
It's locked by the system administrator.

221
00:20:54,040 --> 00:20:55,746
What's that supposed to mean?

222
00:20:56,100 --> 00:20:56,997
Restricted access!

223
00:20:57,080 --> 00:21:00,256
This door was never intended
to be opened by a player!

224
00:21:21,380 --> 00:21:23,380
No. Wait. That's it!

225
00:21:24,880 --> 00:21:27,060
Hey, Yui, see if this'll work.

226
00:21:38,800 --> 00:21:40,420
I'm transferring the code.

227
00:21:54,040 --> 00:21:55,360
We're gonna teleport!

228
00:21:55,740 --> 00:21:57,211
Daddy, give me your hand!

229
00:22:35,220 --> 00:22:38,020
I'm sorry.

230
00:23:02,180 --> 00:23:04,217
Thank you

231
00:23:04,300 --> 00:23:11,300
so

232
00:23:21,320 --> 00:23:23,160
much for watching.

233
00:23:36,080 --> 00:23:38,340
Next time, Gilded Hero.
